comments.body:
I have managed to get it working for Photo Intervals on mission items (see below rudimentary c# example).
Not working for individual TakePhoto mission items though, so working through that.

    mavSdkSystem.CameraServer.TakePhoto().Do(
      takePhotoInt =>
      {
        _logger.LogInformation("CameraServer.TakePhoto - {takePhotoInt}", takePhotoInt);
      },
      exception =>
      {
        _logger.LogError("CameraServer.TakePhoto error - {exception}", exception);
      }).Retry().Subscribe();

